---
// Apple Bento chat showcase — #f5f5f7 silver band, #ffffff 22px Bento cards, #0071e3 Cupertino Blue user bubbles.
---

<section class="showcase-band" id="showcase" aria-labelledby="showcase-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">日常工作流</p>
      <h2 id="showcase-heading">像群友一样接话，像工具一样交活。</h2>
      <p class="subcopy">按真实机制重绘，昵称均为占位。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-chats">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <article class="bento-card" aria-label="示例一：联网查梗与行情，附来源编号">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="card-title">联网核对与出处</span>
          <span class="card-tag">自动标明来源</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-stage">
          <div class="msg-group right">
            <span class="sender">群友 A</span>
            <div class="bubble user">
              @gaoji 「草台班子理论」最早哪来的？顺便查查这周 DDR5 还在涨吗
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="msg-group left">
            <span class="sender">gaoji · 机器人</span>
            <div class="bubble bot">
              出自 2023 年底走红的一篇职场随笔，用来调侃表面精密的组织内部其实靠临时凑合运转 <sup class="cite">[1]</sup>。
            </div>
            <div class="bubble bot">
              内存这周横盘了：32GB（16G×2）DDR5-6000 现货均价停在 680～740 元区间，没继续往上冲 <sup class="cite">[2]</sup>。
              <div class="citations">
                <span>[1] 流行语考据：草台班子出处梳理</span>
                <span>[2] 本周存储渠道现货周报</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <article class="bento-card" aria-label="示例二：看图排错">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="card-title">看图识图</span>
          <span class="card-tag">截图直接排错</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-stage">
          <div class="msg-group right">
            <span class="sender">群友 B</span>
            <div class="bubble user bubble-media">
              <div class="mac-term" role="img" aria-label="终端报错示意：UnicodeDecodeError gbk codec can't decode byte">
                <div class="mac-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>parse_log.py</span></div>
                <pre><code>line 14: open("notes.md").read()
UnicodeDecodeError: 'gbk' codec
can't decode byte 0xac in pos 42</code></pre>
              </div>
              <div class="media-text">@gaoji 刚拉下来的脚本跑不通，怎么改？</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="msg-group left">
            <span class="sender">gaoji · 机器人</span>
            <div class="bubble bot">
              第 14 行没写编码，Windows 默认拿 GBK 读 UTF-8 文件导致的。
            </div>
            <div class="bubble bot">
              改成 <code>open("notes.md", encoding="utf-8")</code> 就行。
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <article class="bento-card" aria-label="示例三：后台生成 PDF 并发送文件">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="card-title">做文件与 PDF</span>
          <span class="card-tag">独立沙盒交付</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-stage">
          <div class="msg-group right">
            <span class="sender">群友 C</span>
            <div class="bubble user">
              @gaoji 把刚才报名的露营装备、食材分工和集合时间整理成一份中文 PDF 发群里
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="msg-group left">
            <span class="sender">gaoji · 机器人</span>
            <div class="bubble bot progress-msg">
              <span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              已交给后台整理记录并排版 PDF，做好发出来。
            </div>
            <div class="bubble bot">
              <div class="file-tile">
                <span class="pdf-badge">PDF</span>
                <div class="file-info">
                  <strong>周末露营装备与分工.pdf</strong>
                  <span>146 KB · 中文字体已嵌入</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              按「公共装备 / 食材采购 / 时间表」排好了，手机直接打开就能看。
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <article class="bento-card" aria-label="示例四：群聊自然接话与表情包">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="card-title">自然接话与表情包</span>
          <span class="card-tag">可用 /config 开关</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-stage">
          <div class="msg-group left">
            <span class="sender">群友 A</span>
            <div class="bubble bot">今晚十一点前绝对睡，再熬夜我是小狗</div>
          </div>

          <div class="msg-group left">
            <span class="sender">群友 B</span>
            <div class="bubble bot">这话我上周五好像也截过图</div>
          </div>

          <div class="msg-group left">
            <span class="sender">gaoji · 机器人</span>
            <div class="bubble bot">上次你说「绝对」的时候，外头早餐铺都出摊了。</div>
            <div class="sticker-tile" role="img" aria-label="表情包示意：简约线条小猫熬夜">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 138 66" width="134" height="64" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="0.75" y="0.75" width="136.5" height="64.5" rx="14" fill="var(--gj-surface-card)" stroke="var(--gj-border)" />
                <path d="M23 37 L20 21 L31 28 Q41 25 51 28 L62 21 L59 37 Q62 47 53 52 Q41 56 29 52 Q20 47 23 37 Z" fill="none" stroke="var(--gj-text)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M30 38h6M46 38h6" stroke="var(--gj-text)" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <circle cx="41" cy="44" r="2" fill="none" stroke="var(--gj-text-secondary)" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                <text x="72" y="33" font-family="var(--gj-font-mono)" font-size="10" font-weight="600" fill="var(--gj-link)">02:14</text>
                <text x="72" y="47" font-size="10" fill="var(--gj-text-muted)">再刷五分钟</text>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .showcase-band {
    background: var(--gj-bg-alt);
    padding: 5rem 1.25rem;
    scroll-margin-top: 44px;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-intro {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--gj-link);
  }

  .section-intro h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.6vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.028em;
    line-height: 1.18;
    color: var(--gj-text);
  }

  .subcopy {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    color: var(--gj-text-muted);
  }

  .bento-chats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .bento-card {
    background: var(--gj-surface-card);
    border-radius: 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gj-border);
    padding: 1.35rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gj-border);
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--gj-text);
  }

  .card-tag {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--gj-text-muted);
    background: var(--gj-chat-bg);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 980px;
  }

  .chat-stage {
    background: var(--gj-chat-bg);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .msg-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.28rem;
  }

  .msg-group.right {
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .msg-group.left {
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .sender {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--gj-text-muted);
    padding: 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .bubble {
    max-width: 88%;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.56;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .bubble.user {
    background: var(--gj-chat-user-bg);
    color: var(--gj-chat-user-text);
    border-bottom-right-radius: 5px;
  }

  .bubble-media {
    padding: 0.5rem;
  }

  .media-text {
    padding: 0.45rem 0.35rem 0.15rem;
  }

  .bubble.bot {
    background: var(--gj-chat-bot-bg);
    color: var(--gj-chat-bot-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--gj-border);
    border-bottom-left-radius: 5px;
  }

  .progress-msg {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.48rem;
    font-size: 0.81rem;
    color: var(--gj-text-secondary);
  }

  .live-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #30d158;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cite {
    font-family: var(--gj-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--gj-link);
  }

  .citations {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 0.45rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gj-border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.14rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--gj-text-muted);
  }

  .mac-term {
    background: #141416;
    border-radius: 11px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .mac-dots {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 0.36rem 0.65rem;
    background: #1f1f22;
  }

  .mac-dots i {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #48484a;
  }

  .mac-dots span {
    margin-left: 0.35rem;
    font-family: var(--gj-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: #98989d;
  }

  .mac-term pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.68rem;
    font-family: var(--gj-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #ff9f92;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .bubble code {
    font-family: var(--gj-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8em;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.36rem;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: var(--gj-chat-bg);
  }

  .mac-term pre code {
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: inherit;
  }

  .file-tile {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: var(--gj-chat-bg);
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }

  .pdf-badge {
    font-family: var(--gj-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.42rem;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #1d1d1f;
    color: #f5f5f7;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .pdf-badge {
    background: #2c2c2e;
  }

  .file-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .file-info strong {
    font-size: 0.81rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gj-text);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .file-info span {
    font-size: 0.71rem;
    color: var(--gj-text-muted);
  }

  .sticker-tile {
    display: inline-flex;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .showcase-band {
      padding: 3.6rem 1.15rem;
    }

    .bento-chats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
